From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PS3 Linux project <ps3@localhost>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:28:21 +0300
Subject: debian: build luanti and luanti-server on ppc64

Debian lists only the architectures with LuaJIT; libluajit-5.1-dev exists for ppc64 (debian-ports), so the PS3 keeps LuaJIT (-DREQUIRE_LUAJIT=TRUE).

diff --git a/debian/control b/debian/control
--- a/debian/control
+++ b/debian/control
@@ -38,7 +38,7 @@ Vcs-Git: https://salsa.debian.org/games-team/luanti.git
 Vcs-Browser: https://salsa.debian.org/games-team/luanti
 
 Package: luanti
-Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf loong64 ppc64el riscv64 s390x
+Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf loong64 ppc64 ppc64el riscv64 s390x
 Depends:
  luanti-data (= ${source:Version}),
  ${misc:Depends},
@@ -55,7 +55,7 @@ Description: Multiplayer infinite-world block sandbox
  generator.
 
 Package: luanti-server
-Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf loong64 ppc64el riscv64 s390x
+Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf loong64 ppc64 ppc64el riscv64 s390x
 Depends:
  luanti-data (= ${source:Version}),
  luanti-game-minetest,
